Column name: bom_r50_sw Type: NUMBER Description: These are the mean radius (from the system centre) of the extent of winds; storm-force (25m/s) or above. Southwest quadrant.
Column name: reunion_wind Type: NUMBER Description: Maximum average wind speed
Column name: mlc_class Type: TEXT Description: Storm classification EX - Extratropical HU - Hurricane LO - Low MH SD - Subtropical depression SS - Subtropical storm TD - Tropical Depression TS - Tropical Storm TW WV - Open Wave
Column name: bom_type Type: NUMBER Description: This indicates the type of system that this cyclone was at the time of the observation. Note that cyclones can evolve during their lifetimes and hence change type mid-stream (e.g. Extratropical transition (ETT))
Column name: reunion_r34_nw Type: NUMBER Description: 34 kt wind radii maximum extent in northwestern quadrant
Column name: newdelhi_dp Type: NUMBER Description: 
